OL,3,AIndonesia's vice president resigns amid
OL,4,Asigns ruling alliance is fraying
OL,5,
OL,6,FIndonesia's Vice-President Gibran
OL,7,FRakabuming Raka has submitted his
OL,8,Fresignation, an aide has told the BBC,
OL,9,Fin a move which could further strain
OL,10,Fthe political alliance that helped
OL,11,Fpropel President Prabowo Subianto to
OL,12,Fpower.
OL,14,FIt comes after Indonesia's Supreme
OL,15,FCourt ruled that a high-school document
OL,16,Fused during Gibran's 2024 election
OL,17,Fcampaign was invalid.
OL,19,FThe ruling prompted more than 100
OL,20,Flawmakers to support a parliamentary
OL,21,Finitiative that could have paved the
OL,22,Fway for proceedings to impeach Gibran.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
