OL,3,AIndonesia's vice president resigns amid
OL,4,Asigns ruling alliance is fraying
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe aide, Budi Arie, said Gibran's
OL,7,Fresignation letter was submitted
OL,8,Fdirectly to Prabowo on Wednesday. It
OL,9,Fremains unclear if it has been
OL,10,Faccepted.
